<title>USA: Donna Karan sheared at opening.</title>
<headline>Donna Karan sheared at opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donna Karan International Inc shares fell more than 20 percent at the opening of trading, off 3-5/8 to 15-1/8 after several analysts cut their profit estimates for the designer.</p>
<p>The shares touched a new 52-week low of 14-3/4 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
